  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A browser for a merged multilingual wordnet. You search for senses by exact word, wildcard pattern, Interlingual Index (ILI) id or definition text, filter by language or part of speech, and open a concept to see its definitions, relations, the words that express it in each language, and which source wordnet each record came from. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
